{
  "category": "Scratch Cat Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Adores circular objects. Wanders the streets on a nightly basis to look for dropped loose change.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adores circular objects. Wanders the streets on a nightly basis to look for dropped loose change.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Appears to be more active at night. It loves round and shiny things. It can't stop from picking them up.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is fascinated by round objects. It can't stop playing with them until it tires and falls asleep.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves anything that shines. It especially adores coins that it picks up and secretly hoards.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves things that sparkle. When it sees a shiny object, the gold coin on its head shines too.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "MEOWTH withdraws its sharp claws into its paws to slinkily sneak about without making any incriminating footsteps. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "MEOWTH withdraws its sharp claws into its paws to slinkily sneak about without making any incriminating footsteps. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "MEOWTH withdraw their sharp claws into their paws to silently sneak about. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "All it does is sleep during the daytime. At night, it patrols its territory with its eyes aglow.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adores round objects. It wanders the streets on a nightly basis to look for dropped loose change.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly.",
